om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/om-route/gate_om_route.om: Pure seeded-OM-2 End-to-End Verification Gate for om_route.om.
note
note Build:
note   seed/out/omc < apps/om-route/gate_om_route.om > gate_om_route && chmod +x gate_om_route
note Run:
note   gate_om_route OMC_BIN REPO_ROOT SCRATCH_DIR
note
note Spins up two pure-OM-2 loopback mock backends (fast + slow-SSE), launches om_route.om against
note a declarative models.tsv, and verifies:
note   - 2x deterministic compilation of om_route.om (0 stderr, bit-identical SHA-256)
note   - GET /health reading live Spark /sys/class/thermal/thermal_zone5/temp (TGPU) & zone0 (TSOC)
note   - GET /v1/models declarative catalog
note   - POST /v1/chat/completions: OpenAI string content, Open WebUI array-of-parts content, live SSE stream
note   - POST /v1/messages: Anthropic JSON (with system + content blocks) and Anthropic live SSE translation
note   - Non-blocking multi-client pollfds concurrency (fast client overtakes slow-streaming client!)
note   - Structured local-only TY-4+ telemetry lines in router stdout
note   - 6 fail-closed negative controls: live thermal 503 thermal_budget_exceeded, unknown model 404,
note     path traversal 400, bad HTTP verbs 405, malformed non-loopback config exit 2, malformed cols exit 2.

note ---- Embedded FIPS 180-4 SHA-256
global s2_ok ulong 1
global s2_k uint 64
global s2_h uint 8
global s2_w uint 64
global s2_buf uchar 64
global s2_n ulong 1
global s2_tot ulong 1
global s2_out uchar 32

note ---- Buffers
global g_omc uchar 4096
global g_root uchar 4096
global g_scr uchar 4096
global g_pa uchar 4096
global g_pin uchar 64
global g_d1 uchar 32
global g_d2 uchar 32
global g_av uchar 16384
global g_stb uchar 4
global g_fbuf uchar 65536
global g_wbuf uchar 65536
global g_rbuf uchar 131072
global g_rbuf2 uchar 65536
global g_mbuf uchar 65536
global g_echo uchar 4096
global g_std uchar 65536
global g_n ulong 32
note g_n:
note   0=omc_len 1=root_len 2=scr_len 3=pa_len 4=av_bytes 5=av_argc
note   6=wbuf_len 7=rbuf_len 8=rbuf2_len 9=std_len 10=checks 11=ctrls
note   12=caught 13=fails 14=p_route 15=p_fast 16=p_slow
note   17=pid_fast 18=pid_slow 19=pid_route 20=echo_len

